### Place BUY order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"traderId":"T001","stock":"AAPL","sector":"TECH","quantity":50,"side":"BUY"}

### Add starting holdings
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traders/T001/portfolio/holdings
Content-Type: application/json

{"stock":"AAPL","sector":"TECH","quantity":100}

### Portfolio
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traders/T001/portfolio

### Sector overlap
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traders/T001/sector-overlap
